<template><section class="wiki-home"><div class="home-intro"><span class="eyebrow">MC {{stats.minecraft}} · {{stats.version}}</span><h1>{{en?'Your journey through Gensokyo':'在幻想乡开始你的旅程'}}</h1><p>{{en?'A practical guide to the items, recipes and mechanics in ReverieDreams.':'从搭建祭坛到经营食堂，按实际游戏内容找到下一步。'}}</p><form class="home-search" @submit.prevent="go"><input v-model="search" :placeholder="en?'Search items, dishes and materials':'查找物品、料理或材料…'" aria-label="Search wiki"><button type="submit">{{en?'Explore':'查图鉴'}} →</button></form><div class="home-metrics"><span><strong>{{stats.items}}</strong>{{en?'items':'件物品'}}</span><span><strong>{{stats.blocks}}</strong>{{en?'blocks':'种方块'}}</span><span><strong>{{stats.recipes}}</strong>{{en?'recipes':'条配方'}}</span><span><strong>{{stats.entities}}</strong>{{en?'entities':'种实体'}}</span></div></div><div class="home-paths"><a v-for="(card,i) in cards" :key="card.link" :href="withBase(prefix+card.link)"><span class="path-number">0{{i+1}}</span><strong>{{card.title}}</strong><p>{{card.description}}</p><span class="path-arrow">↗</span></a></div><p class="home-note">{{en?'Names and recipe data are synchronized from the mod. Open any item to inspect its model, ingredients, uses and loot-table records.':'名称与配方数据从模组同步。点开物品，可查看模型、材料、用途和战利品记录。'}}</p></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
